1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:12,202
A new Google advertisement has become a heated online topic because it imagines America's founders welcoming AI during the writing of the Declaration of Independence.

2
00:00:12,152 --> 00:00:17,049
The Verge criticized the message as clumsy and irritating.

3
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:23,770
The reaction matters because AI companies are trying to make their tools feel normal and helpful.

4
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:31,667
But when history is used too casually, audiences may see the campaign as disrespectful or forced.

